  "post_title": "Rock solidario en el Casal Jove de Onda a beneficio de Quisqueya y Trailwalker",
  "post_date": "2012-03-25 12:59:20",
  "post_name": "rock-solidario-en-el-casal-jove-de-onda-a-beneficio-de-quisqueya-y-trailwalker",
